# FILSYS investigator on the WINCHESTER (DISC-74MB-1) - exercises the
# FAT-chain-fixed disc read path directly, no full SINTRAN boot needed.
FAILON o update and check directories
LABEL boot FILSYS from tape
SEND 400&
EXPECT 40 File System Investigator
EXPECT 10 Device name
SEND DISC-74MB-1
SENDCR
EXPECT 15 Device unit
SEND 0
SENDCR
LABEL waiting for the disc to open (FAT walk over a 75 MB image)
EXPECT 120 Total no\. of disk pages
EXPECT 15 >
LABEL LIST-USERS on the Winchester
SEND LIST-USERS
SENDCR
EXPECT 30 User
EXPECT 15 >
LABEL LIST-FILE-NAMES user 0
SEND LIST-FILE-NAMES
SENDCR
EXPECT 10 User no\.
SENDCR
EXPECT 60 >
QUIET 5
